The native Python bridge in native/ links the official Filen Rust SDK:

- filen-sdk-rs (https://github.com/FilenCloudDienste/filen-rs),
  AGPL-3.0, Copyright (c) FilenCloudDienste GmbH.
  The exact revision is pinned in native/Cargo.toml. The bridge only exposes a
  small UniFFI surface; login, key derivation, encryption, metadata handling and
  all transfers are implemented by filen-sdk-rs.

The integration structure follows ha-internxt
(https://github.com/TheRealSimon42/ha-internxt), MIT license.

The Filen logo and wordmark in custom_components/filen/brand/ come from the
official Filen press kit (https://filen.io/hub/content/files/2025/06/Filen-Press-Kit.zip)
and are used only to identify the Filen service. All rights remain with Filen.

This is a community project, not an official Filen product.
